# The plasma pistol charged, at a target three units away that stands still: held
# for 0.6 s (18 ticks) and let go, the button fires the second trigger's shot, an
# overcharged bolt of 70 that makes all the heat the gauge has (the weapon is
# overheated until it has cooled); let go sooner it is an ordinary bolt. The
# heat is not lost while a full charge is held.
scenario plasma_pistol_charge
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/plasma pistol/plasma pistol
ticks 420
# aim at the body
input 0 420 pitch=-0.13
# an ordinary bolt: let go before the charge is full
input 60 70 fire=1
# a charged one, held for half a second more than it takes
input 100 130 fire=1
# held the whole time the weapon is overheated and a while after, and let go
input 140 230 fire=1
# a charged one again, once the weapon has cooled
input 280 310 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
